  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator II</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Insitu-TP-Lam-II-a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Processes tape up to 3 inch (76 mm) wide</li>\n<li>Closed-Loop substrate preheat</li>\n<li>Heated laydown nip</li>\n<li>Cut-on- fly capable</li>\n<li>Conformable head</li>\n<li>Out of autoclave processing</li>\n<li>Composite products include skin/stringer, honeycomb, and TiGr laminates</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Automated Tape Laying</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/automated-tape-laminator/\">Automated Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/ply-by-ply-tape-laminator/\">Ply-by-Ply Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/tp-staker-laminator/\">Thermoplastic Staker / Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/electron-beam-tape-laminator/\">Electron Beam Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-i/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator I</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-ii/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/lab-scale-atl-machine/\">Lab-Scale ATL Machine</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Insitu-TP-Lam-II-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Insitu-TP-Lam-II-b-300x207.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"207\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Insitu-TP-Lam-II-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Insitu-TP-Lam-II-a-300x258.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"258\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
